WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Twelve minutes is twelve minutes.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.000
A free timer can mark a quiet practice.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Zen12 sells a structured library of recordings.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Its claim of an hour's benefits needs a direct test.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Related EEG findings are mixed, not product validation.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:36.000
Compare what you value: format, routine, and alternatives.

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Read the evidence before any purchase.
